  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_aglett_cb1926f214e648fd50a7064c43fc8e36e1701ebef11292e819e99f6fbc8700d6a75">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Tags or ornaments at the ends of laces, ribbons, or points that tie garments or footwear. Also refers to any of various ornamental tags, studs, or plates worn on costume; may be at pendent end of a cord or similar object or sewn directly onto garments or headgear. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
